      "type": "cover",
      "main": "Why the Neon",
      "sub": "It wasn't fashion. It was survival."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "The fluorescent yellow was not about style.",
        "It was how you found your people",
        "in the dark."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1988.",
        "People came in shoes they could run in.",
        "In case they needed to leave fast.",
        "Or move to the next location."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "UV gear traced your outline in the crowd.",
        "Dummies stopped the jaw grinding.",
        "Kandi bracelets said: you are one of us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1994.",
        "The government made raves illegal.",
        "For the first time,",
        "a hood had a reason."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": ["Being anonymous", "became resistance."],
      "note": "The hood was political."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "This look was not designed.",
        "It was built by the night",
        "and what the night demanded."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": ["The origin of this aesthetic", "is after dark."],
      "strobe": "🌑",
      "cta": "Save this."
    }
